# Agent extras use an unquoted YAML scalar `model: {{TIER_*}}`. Prettier's YAML
# formatter parses `{{...}}` as a flow mapping and reprints it as `{ { TIER_* } }`,
# which destroys the install-time tier token. Keep these files, and their
# byte-identical plugin/assets mirrors, out of Prettier.
extras/
plugin/assets/extras/

# agents/ and skills/ are already ignored above. Their packaged copies must stay
# byte-identical (tests/plugin-assets-parity.test.ts). Ignoring the mirrors
# prevents a later `prettier --write` from formatting only one side.
plugin/assets/agents/
plugin/assets/skills/
